WEBVTT

00:03:55.583 --> 00:04:00.460
Kwa watu kama sisi 
tunaotangamana na wasomi,

00:04:00.484 --> 00:04:03.753
ni rahisi kusahau hakika sahili:

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:08.525
Watu wengi hawana sahada
la miaka minee chuoni.

00:04:09.077 --> 00:04:13.208
Kwa hakika, thuluthi mbili
Wamerikani hawana.

00:04:13.978 --> 00:04:18.042
Kwa hivyo ni upumbavu kujenga uchumi

00:04:18.066 --> 00:04:23.243
inayoshurutisha shahada ya chuo

00:04:23.267 --> 00:04:26.542
ili kuwepo na maisha sharifu.

00:04:27.307 --> 00:04:30.958
Kuhimiza watu kwenda chuo 
ni wazo mzuri.